        Rscript scripts/molecular_state_calculator.R\
            --results {input.results} \
            --effect_size {wildcards.effect_size} \
            --samp_n {wildcards.samp_n} \
            --cell_count {wildcards.cell_count} \
            --rep {wildcards.rep} \
            --rand {wildcards.rand_seed} \
            --threshold 0.01 
        """
#then I run the above rules on cell type B


